"### \u2464 Central Banks\n\n<sub>**Caveat:** these are *reported* year-end reserve levels, and flows are derived as the year-over-year difference. Reported changes can include revaluations, gold swaps and reclassifications, and several buyers \u2014 China most notably \u2014 report on a lag or only partially. Treat this as reported data, not audited flow.</sub>"